    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`monoServer` is the primary development server module for the `startio` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for dev-scoped server activation, route/service availability, and runtime topology. Business behavior belongs in active application or framework modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Development server settings should stay explicit and replaceable by higher environment server modules."
    }
